run notes. The Chapter 1 structure will also be adjusted, to display the complete branching structure and proper flow from \"Day Release\" to \"Doin' Gone.\"\n\n\nChapter 2 structure will be strictly sequential, featuring four chronological stages.  Each stage will include milestone connectors to clearly indicate the progression between them. Chapter 3's heist preparation pipeline will detail three parallel tracks branching from the scope out mission.  All three tracks will converge into the final heist mission with no horizontal connections between track steps. Chapter 4's structure mirrors Chapter 2, designed to be strictly sequential with four chronological stages.\n\n\nThe flowchart structure will incorporate a new organization based on mission stages, starting with a 75k wire transfer. Stages 2, 3, and 4 outline Syndicate, Airport, and VCIA operations, respectively, each with specific mission sequences and milestone connectors. The focus now is on integrating all corrections into a unified flowchart; it requires rebuilding the `build_speedrun_flowcharts.py` script. The goal is a complete and clean replacement of the existing script to generate accurate PNGs. The script's helper functions will need reviewing.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Complete rewrite of scratch/build_speedrun_flowcharts.py implementing authentic parallel Chapter 1 matching image_1188e9.jpg, correcting Doin' Gone, ending at Doin' Gone, and updating Any% campaign master flowchart.\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\\nimport matplotlib.patches as patches\\nimport os\\nimport shutil\\n\\nWORKSPACE_DIR = r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\<user>\\\\Downloads\\\\GTA6.Xbox.v1.0.2.1-CYBERLEEK\\\"\\nDOWNLOADS_DIR = r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\<user>\\\\Downloads\\\"\\nARTIFACT_DIR = r\\\"C:\\\\Users\\\\<user>\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity-cli\\\\brain\\\\96252013-4633-45e8-b6a2-59b18be9e68c\\\"\\n\\nBG_CO