"Bottleneck: Checking Out\"| C3\n35:     C3 -->|\"Bottleneck: Ocean Beach\"| C4\n36:     C4 -->|\"Point of No Return: Sunset\"| C5\n37: ```\n38: \n39: ---\n40: \n41: ## 2. Chapter 1: Just Like Paradise (Leonida Keys)\n42: \n43: ### Mechanics\n<truncated 4087 bytes>\nrrently:\n124:   1. **Tyrone Strand (Street Muscle)**: Missions 51 & 52.\n125:   2. **Boobie Ike & Dre'Quan Strand (Syndicate & Nightclub)**: Missions 54, 55, & 56.\n126:   3. **Raul Bautista & Randy Strand (Cartel Logistics & Exotic Cars)**: Missions 53, 57, 58, 59, & 60.\n127: - **Dynamic Interleaving vs. Concurrent Map Pins**: In casual play, waiting allows all three contacts to be active simultaneously as map pins. In speedrunning, finishing a mission places that contact on a brief cooldown timer while another contact rings, causing an optimal Any% runner to zigzag between Tyrone, Boobie, and Raul with zero downtime.\n128: - **Major Heist**: **The Sinfrontera National Bank Heist**. All 3 strands converge at *Mission 61: Sinfrontera National Bank Scope Out*, unlocking the modular heist preparation board and culminating in *Mission 70: The Cartel Heist* ($10.5M Take).\n129: \n130: ```mermaid\n131: flowchart TD\n132:     C2_End[\"From Ch. 2: Checking Out\"] --> M45[\"45. Welcome to Vice City\"]\n133:     M45 --> M46[\"46. Dealer's Choice\"]\n134:     M46 --> M47[\"47. Meet the Heders\"]\n135:     M47 --> M48[\"48. Dubious Provenance\"]\n136:     M48 --> M49[\"49. Mami Knows Best\"]\n137:     M49 --> M50[\"50. South Leonida Real Estate<br/>(Vice City Safehouse Unlocked)\"]\n138:     \n139:     subgraph Parallel_Strands[\"Vice City Syndicate Alliances (3 Parallel Strands)\"]\n140:         direction TB\n141:         subgraph Strand_Tyrone[\"Strand 1: Tyrone (Muscle)\"]\n142:             M51[\"51. Tyrone\"] --> M52[\"52. Here, Kitty Kitty\"]\n143:         end\n144:         \n145:         subgraph Strand_Boobie[\"Strand 2: Boobie & Dre'Quan (Syndicate)\"]\n146:             M54[\"54. Top Billing\"] --> M55[\"